  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Livestock Sector Development Project Activities</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">As part of the EC - World Bank Partnership Programme Part III for Europe and Central Asia Programmatic Single-Donor Trust Fund - Livestock Sector Development Project Activitiescomma and in line with the new European Consensus on Developmentcomma the European Commission has expressed an interest in ensuring that the Bank provides support to Uzbekistan in the framework of the Trust Fund with the specific objective to assist Uzbekistan improve livestock sector productivity and access to market in selected regions of Uzbekistan.</narrative>
  </description>
